# --- Buildroot external tree layout note ---------------------------------
# A BR2_EXTERNAL tree requires three files at its root, all of which must
# exist even when empty:
#   external.desc  name + description of the tree
#   Config.in      Kconfig sourced into Buildroot's menu (packages)
#   external.mk    makefile glued into Buildroot's build (packages)
# configs/<role>_defconfig and board/<role>/ are then discovered automatically.
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Generated image artifacts: treat as binary, keep out of diffs and GitHub
# language statistics.
images/**     binary linguist-generated
*.ext2        binary
bzImage       binary

# Shell scripts stay LF-terminated regardless of the host's autocrlf setting.
*.sh          text eol=lf
